MomijiStore_OS/06_DocumentIntelligence/**/*.[pP][nN][gG]
MomijiStore_OS/06_DocumentIntelligence/**/*.[hH][eE][iI][cC]
MomijiStore_OS/06_DocumentIntelligence/**/*.[tT][iI][fF]
MomijiStore_OS/06_DocumentIntelligence/**/*.[tT][iI][fF][fF]
